1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,247
When two past events are told together, the earlier one takes the past perfect.

2
00:00:05,247 --> 00:00:08,580
The train left first; then I reached the station.

3
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:11,471
When I reached the station, the train had left.

4
00:00:11,471 --> 00:00:15,377
If you write the train left, you say it left at the moment you arrived.

